Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:35.02,Black,Twin Turbo,0,0,0,,Vaaaaai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.15,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Ainda não desisti!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:39.85,Black,Air Shakur,0,0,0,,Oraoraoraora!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:51.83,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Elas estão fazendo uma corrida emocionante.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:54.69,Black,Happy Meek,0,0,0,,Vamos lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.50,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Ela está ficando tão perto da mureta nessa velocidade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.70,0:01:06.98,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,E ela também se recuperou perfeitamente?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:13.23,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,{\t(3875,4959,1,\c&H000000&)}Ela... ela está me deixando bem animada também!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:19.60,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Pisa fundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:28.40,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Vai, vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:36.03,Black,Twin Turbo,0,0,0,,Turbo a todo vapor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:38.16,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,O primeiro lugar será meu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:41.10,Black,Air Shakur,0,0,0,,Eu vou revirar a corrida daqui a pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:45.14,Black,Happy Meek,0,0,0,,Está na hora...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:49.17,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Esta presença... não me diga que é o Sopro do Vento?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.43,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Isso é absurdo! Ela nunca vai conseguir fazer a curva!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:06.31,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,D-drift de inércia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:09.36,Black,AS/DS/TT,0,0,0,,Eu não vou perder!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:15.07,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,D-drift de inércia triplo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:20.71,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Eu... eu não consigo mais me aguentar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:25.74,Black,Maruzensky,0,0,0,,Todo mundo vence! Fever!
